  <para style="h">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo gwaJuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo</para>
  <para style="mt1">gwaJUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gunoyi Juda</char> godan'wa nezina lenkwali wago. Juda unozwitula eti unun'una waJakobe, nun'una waYesu. Ndizo kokumbuligwa kuti uwumwe webanun'una baYesu (Juda 1.1). Atitoziba kuti kene lukwalo igogu gwakagwakwaligwa lipi gubungano, kakale nentha yezwimulukwalo igogu zwitondeka kuThesitamente Whulukugwi, banhu bakabakwaligwa naJuda bakafanila bakabe beli maJuta. Koga ke, wakagulingisa “kuna bose bakadan'wa, banodiwa ndiNdzimu Tate bakatjengetegwa Yesu Khirisitu”(Juda 1.1). Lukwalo igogu gungabe gwakakwagwa mumakole angaba makumi matanhatu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tjinangwa tjekwalila maKhirisitu ose lukwalo igogu tjakatjili tjebatjenjedza nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa kuti basibatjengele bebalaha (Juda 1.4). Unoleba nezwiyetikalo zweThesitamente Whulukugwi kudze ndebo iye ibenensindo. Lukwalo igogu goleba zwinhu izo zwazo zwimulukwalo gwaPhethiro webubili zwinohanganyila tjenjedza banhu nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa (Juda 1.4, 2 Phethiro 2.1) kose neleba nekwebatumwa bekudzimu neSodoma neGomora.</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda unolebeleka nebaanokwalila lukwalo (Juda 1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotobela neleba kuti kungentha yeni ebakwalila, waka ebatjenjedza nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa (Juda 1.3-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwayikoku unopa zwilakidzilo zwinobva kubanhu nezwinoyetika muThestamente Whulukugwi (Juda 1.5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unokotjibabudza kakale kuti bathame tjini nekwebatjenjedza (Juda 1.17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kubupelo unopeta lukwalo gugwe ekudza Ndzimu (Juda 1.24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Kubva kunaJuda, nlanda waYesu Khirisitu kakale ali nun'una waJakobe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Kuna ibabo bakadan'wa, banodiwa naNdzimu Tate kakale bakatjengetegwa Yesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Mawhilangoni, nekunyalala neludo ngakuwande kumuli.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Badiyi Bemanyepwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Badikani, ndandinahuha kwazo kuti ndimukwalile nekwejidzo latinalo toseni, ndabona kwakafanila kuti ndimukwalile ndimukuludzile kuti mugwile bugalimoyo Ndzimu gwaakapa bayengemali, gusingake gukahandugwa kene lini. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ngobe bamwe banhu bana tongewa kwabo kwakakwagwa nekwako ntolo, bakangina bakabgwata pakati kwenyu. Ibabo banhu abatohla Ndzimu, banotjinya ngoni dzeNdzimu wedu, kudze batubule thama kusazwibhata kakale belandula Yesu Khirisitu, ibo boga Batezi kakale ali He wedu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Ngwenu ndohaka mukumbudza, nekene munaluzibo guhhele, kuti Yesu wakasunungula banhu babe akabadusa muhango yeIgipita, hule kwayikoko wakapaladza ibabo basakagalamoyo muna iye. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Nebatumwa bekudzimu basakatjengeta zwigalo zwabo zwebutungamili, koga bakasiya bugalo gwabo, wakabasa muhhalima akabatjengeta po bakasungwa nemiketane tjoselele kudze kunoswika hhuba gulu letongewa, <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />sebanhu beSodoma neGomora nemizi-mikulu ipedlo, bakazwipila mukutjiba kwembili nesazwibhata, batjilakidzilo tjebanhu banolangiwa nemoto usingapele.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Nezila yakajalo zwayo, ibaba banhu muwolota kwabo banolonga hambgwa mibili yabo, kakale banolingila pasi masimba eNdzimu, betuka bakakudziwa bekudzimu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Koga ntumwa nkulu wekudzimu Mikhayeli, kwaakabe enyanyayidzana neMvanganyi, begwila mbili waMozisi, haazotongoyedza wumpa ntongo wetukana, koga wakati, “He ngabakutjemele.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Koga banhu ibaba banoleba betuka tjimwe netjimwe tjabasingawhisise; kakale izwezo zwinhu zwabanoziba besazwidiyiwa semhuka dzisingahingise bulubi, ndizo zwinobapaladza. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kwakababangalila tjini! Ngobe banotobela zila yaKhayini, banozwilaha nentha yeda mari nezila isakatambunuka saBhalamu, bakapanduka saKhora, sa iye batjipaladziwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Banonga hambgwa yawila muzodliwa zwelakidza ludo, saku bedla namwi besina honi besingahle, banahanya nekwabo koga; banonga makole asi evula anosengwa nemhepo; banonga miti isina mitjelo mupepwe, yakasipugwa, yakafa. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Semabundo evula yegungwa anabuhongola anopfa mafulo ehambgwa, banopfa zwiyeto zwabo zwinobhatisa honi, banonga nyenyedzi dzinoyenda yenda dzakatjengetegwa hhalima lakati zwi kwazo lisingapele.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Inoki waka eli wetjizekugwana tjekutondeka kubvisila kuna Adamu wakalebesambeli nekwabo eti, “Lingani, He unohha nebakayengemala babe bali zwiwulu zwinjinji, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />ewhotonga bose, newana nlandu bose banotjila nekusazwibhata banothama mihingo yabo yakayipa ngezila isina mazwibhato, nangematama ose anogwadza batjinyi basingahle Ndzimu abakaleba nekukwe.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Ibaba banhu banyanyayidzi, banogala bebvubvuma, banotobela njemulo dzabo, banoteketa bezwikudza, banotjengela bamwe kuti kubhatshike ibo boga.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tjenjedzo neMilayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Koga ke badikani, kumbulani zwakalebesewambeli nebapositoli baHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />bakati kumuli, “Mumahhuba ebupelo kowhobe nebanodadila, banotobela njemulo dzabo dzisina hla Ndzimu.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ndibo ibaba banomusa mhalalano, banhu behango, basina Meya. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Koga imwi, badikani, muzwibumbe muzwibumbila pehhugwi kwekugalamoyo kwenyu kwakayengemala, tembezelani mubhatshiwa neMeya Yakayengemala, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />mugale muli muludo gweNdzimu makalindila He wedu Yesu Khirisitu kuti mumawhilangoni awe amupe butjilo gusingapele.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mube nemawhilangoni kuna banobvubvuma, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />tjidzani bamwe, ngebabhula mumoto; kubamwe mulakidze mawhilangoni akahangana nehla, muheme kene tjiyambalo tjabo tjakalongwa hambgwa nembili unajinyo.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntembezelo weLumbidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Ngwenu ke, iye unotubula mutjengeta kuti musiwe nemuhhisa musina nlandu mbeli kwegudzo lile makahanha, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />iye Ndzimu uyega, Ntjidzi wedu muna Yesu Khirisitu He wedu, ngaapiwe gudzo, bukulu, nendawulo, nemasimba, sekwakabe kuli iko lubaka gwantolo, nangwenu nekusingapele. Akujalo.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>